Any rational explanation for that is beyond my knowledge, but there's
some non-linearity involved w.r.t. strength evolution within the range
18/01 and 18/**, concerning carrying capacity and combat bonuses. And
the carrying capacity between 18/** and 25 is the same, AFAIK. Then
there's also a difference in progression of strength; by eating the
right food you can gain up to 10 points of strength until you reached
18/90 then it continues by 1 point. The higher values, 19 to 25, can
only be reached by special equipment as I already mentioned. Some of
the races are further restricted in strength (AFAIR, gnomes to 18/50,
and elves to 18).

Somewhat digressing, but I have no rational explanation for that. :-}

